---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Terms of use" description="Terms for using Annie 3D.">
  <div class="container prose" style="padding:56px 0 96px">
    <p class="badge badge-warning">Draft for the pre-release · to be reviewed by counsel before launch</p>
    <h1 class="h2" style="margin-top:12px">Terms of use</h1>
    <h2>Your content</h2>
    <p>You keep the rights to the photos you upload and the outputs you create. Only upload products you have the right to advertise.</p>
    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>Do not use Annie 3D to create counterfeit product ads, to impersonate brands or people, or to produce unlawful content.</p>
    <h2>Credits</h2>
    <p>Runs use credits. A run that fails our quality checks is refunded automatically.</p>
    <h2>Pre-release</h2>
    <p>Features may change. We will announce changes that affect your data before they take effect.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
